      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "For your fintech app audit, focusing on WCAG 2.1, you'll want to check a few key areas. Regarding color contrast, ensure that all text and essential graphical elements meet a contrast ratio of at least 4.5:1 for normal text, and 3:1 for large text. For mobile screen reader compatibility, rigorously test navigation flow and ensure all interactive elements have proper, descriptive ARIA labels so the screen reader knows exactly what it's interacting with. This is crucial for users who might be navigating the app without sight, which is a high-stakes area for fintech.",
